Guha recounts offering Lakṣmaṇa a readied bed --- Lakṣmaṇa refuses sleep while Rāma lies on grass with Sītā --- Lakṣmaṇa declares gods cannot endure Rāma in battle --- Lakṣmaṇa foretells king dying and earth widowed --- Lakṣmaṇa fears Kausalyā and mothers die this night --- Lakṣmaṇa pictures Ayōdhyā palace fallen silent --- Lamenting Lakṣmaṇa stands guard till dawn --- Guha ferries matted bark-clad exiles across Gaṅgā at sunrise
